<title>USA: Fife SD 417, Wash., yields 4.90 in 2007.</title>
<headline>Fife SD 417, Wash., yields 4.90 in 2007.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle Northwest Securities Corp</p>
<p>said it priced $8.535 million of Pierce and King Counties School</p>
<p>District 417 (Fife), Wash., general obligation bonds, 1996 with</p>
<p>a top yield of 4.90 percent in 2007.</p>
</text>
